---
title: 雨夜的告白
theme: 温情
synopsis: |
  雨夜广场，米拉偶遇陈伯。一把伞、几句问候，让两个孤独的灵魂在石板路上靠近。
  北路西行，超市里的围巾，以及各自家门前的灯光，为这一夜画上句号。
dsl_version: "1.0"
catalog_version: "1.0.0"
tags: [爱情, 小镇, 雨夜]
cast: [mira, old_chen]
scenes: [plaza, supermarket_interior]
acts: 2
duration_estimate: 180
tone: 治愈
author: example
language: zh-CN
---

@BEGIN title="雨夜的告白"

@ACT id=1 title="雨夜广场"

@SCENE id=plaza time=evening weather=rain

@CAST actor=mira
@CAST actor=old_chen

@SPAWN_WALKWAY id=plaza_rain_path from=(10, 5.85) to=(28, 5.85) width=1.2
@SPAWN_WALKWAY id=plaza_rain_lane_left from=(10, 5.55) to=(19.5, 10) width=1.2
@SPAWN_WALKWAY id=plaza_rain_lane_right from=(10, 6.15) to=(20.5, 10) width=1.2
@SPAWN_WALKWAY id=rain_west_lane_left from=(19.5, 10) to=(5, 10) width=1.2
@SPAWN_WALKWAY id=rain_west_lane_right from=(20.5, 10) to=(6, 10) width=1.2

@SPAWN_PROP prop=supermarket id=shop_1 at=(14, 10.6) state=open
@SPAWN_PROP prop=shop_door id=shop_door_1 at=(14.2, 10.6) state=open
@SPAWN_PROP prop=home_door id=mira_home_door at=(5.2, 10.6) state=open
@SPAWN_PROP prop=home_door id=chen_home_door at=(6.3, 10.6) state=open

@LAYOUT id=plaza_rain_row

@ENTER actor=mira at=(10, 5.85) facing=south
@MOVE_TO actor=mira to_path=plaza_rain_path x=10.6
@SIT actor=mira bench=bench_1 seat=0

@ENTER actor=old_chen at=(28, 5.85) facing=south
@SPAWN_PROP prop=umbrella id=umbrella_1 attach=old_chen offset=(0.4, 0) state=open
@CUT preset=cam_follow target=mira

@NARRATION duration=2.5
雨点敲打着广场的石板路，路灯在水洼里碎成一片金光。

@DIALOGUE speaker=mira auto=true auto_delay=2.5
「今晚的雨，好像永远不会停。」
@END

@MOVE_TO actor=old_chen to_path=plaza_rain_path x=21

@DIALOGUE speaker=old_chen auto=true auto_delay=2.5
「年轻人，伞借你一半。」
@END

@STAND actor=mira

@DIALOGUE speaker=mira auto=true auto_delay=2
「谢谢您，陈伯。我这就过来。」
@END

@PARALLEL
  @MOVE_TO actor=mira to_path=plaza_rain_lane_left x=20
  @MOVE_TO actor=old_chen to_path=plaza_rain_lane_right x=20
@END

@DIALOGUE speaker=mira auto=true auto_delay=2
「有伞真好，雨声也没那么冷了。」
@END

@DIALOGUE speaker=old_chen auto=true auto_delay=2.5
「一起走一段吧。」
@END

@DIALOGUE speaker=mira auto=true auto_delay=2
「雨夜广场，走起来也没那么孤单了。」
@END

@PARALLEL
  @MOVE_TO actor=mira to_path=plaza_rain_lane_left y=10
  @MOVE_TO actor=old_chen to_path=plaza_rain_lane_right y=10
@END

@NARRATION duration=2.5
两个人肩并肩走在雨中，广场的灯光忽然变得柔和起来。

@ACT id=2 title="北路与超市"

@NARRATION duration=2.5
北路尽头向左一转，雨夜里亮着灯的超市出现在前方。

@PARALLEL
  @MOVE_TO actor=mira to_path=rain_west_lane_left x=15.5
  @MOVE_TO actor=old_chen to_path=rain_west_lane_right x=15.5
@END

@DIALOGUE speaker=old_chen auto=true auto_delay=2.5
「进去买吧，我在门口等你。」
@END

@MOVE_TO actor=mira to_path=rain_west_lane_left x=14.2
@MOVE_TO actor=old_chen to_path=rain_west_lane_right x=14.8

@FACE actor=old_chen facing=south

@EXIT actor=old_chen

@SCENE id=supermarket_interior time=evening weather=clear

@CAST actor=cashier

@SPAWN_WALKWAY id=shop_interior_aisle from=(6, 2) to=(6, 8) width=1.0
@SPAWN_PROP prop=shop_shelf id=shelf_1 at=(6, 8) state=stocked
@SPAWN_PROP prop=checkout_counter id=checkout_1 at=(4, 2) state=open
@ENTER actor=cashier at=(4.5, 2) facing=east

@MOVE_TO actor=mira to=(6, 2) duration=0
@FACE actor=mira facing=north

@MOVE_TO actor=mira to_path=shop_interior_aisle y=7.8

@SET_PROP id=shelf_1 state=empty
@SPAWN_PROP prop=scarf id=scarf_1 attach=mira offset=(0.2, 0.05) state=worn

@DIALOGUE speaker=mira auto=true auto_delay=2
「这条围巾，应该会暖和些。」
@END

@MOVE_TO actor=mira to_path=shop_interior_aisle y=2.2
@FACE actor=mira facing=west

@DIALOGUE speaker=mira auto=true auto_delay=1.5
「老板，结账。」
@END

@DIALOGUE speaker=cashier auto=true auto_delay=1.5
「好的，请慢走。」
@END

@EXIT actor=cashier

@SCENE id=plaza time=evening weather=rain

@SPAWN_WALKWAY id=plaza_rain_path from=(10, 5.85) to=(28, 5.85) width=1.2
@SPAWN_WALKWAY id=plaza_rain_lane_left from=(10, 5.55) to=(19.5, 10) width=1.2
@SPAWN_WALKWAY id=plaza_rain_lane_right from=(10, 6.15) to=(20.5, 10) width=1.2
@SPAWN_WALKWAY id=rain_west_lane_left from=(19.5, 10) to=(5, 10) width=1.2
@SPAWN_WALKWAY id=rain_west_lane_right from=(20.5, 10) to=(6, 10) width=1.2

@LAYOUT id=plaza_rain_row
@SPAWN_PROP prop=supermarket id=shop_1 at=(14, 10.6) state=open
@SPAWN_PROP prop=shop_door id=shop_door_1 at=(14.2, 10.6) state=open
@SPAWN_PROP prop=home_door id=mira_home_door at=(5.2, 10.6) state=open
@SPAWN_PROP prop=home_door id=chen_home_door at=(6.3, 10.6) state=open

@ENTER actor=old_chen at=(14.8, 10) facing=south
@SPAWN_PROP prop=umbrella id=umbrella_1 attach=old_chen offset=(0.4, 0) state=open
@MOVE_TO actor=mira to=(14.5, 10) duration=0

@DIALOGUE speaker=mira auto=true auto_delay=2
「陈伯，送给您。」
@END

@GIVE actor=mira id=scarf_1 to=old_chen

@DIALOGUE speaker=old_chen auto=true auto_delay=2.5
「好孩子……谢谢你。」
@END

@NARRATION duration=2
两人重新并肩上路，向西穿过雨幕。

@PARALLEL
  @MOVE_TO actor=mira to_path=rain_west_lane_left x=5.2
  @MOVE_TO actor=old_chen to_path=rain_west_lane_right x=6.3
@END

@DIALOGUE speaker=mira auto=true auto_delay=2
「到家了。晚安，陈伯。」
@END

@DIALOGUE speaker=old_chen auto=true auto_delay=2.5
「晚安，米拉。路上小心。」
@END

@PARALLEL
  @MOVE_TO actor=mira to=(5.2, 10)
  @MOVE_TO actor=old_chen to=(6.3, 10)
@END

@NARRATION duration=2.5
两扇门里的灯光先后暖起来，雨夜终于各自安静。

@END_SCRIPT
